cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sudan Atlas in a report, paper or product, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Sudan Atlas: official names, P-codes and boundaries for Sudan's states and localities"
abstract: >-
  An open toolkit that matches Sudanese place names written in Arabic or English, in any
  spelling, to official P-codes, and gives the names and boundaries of Sudan's 18 states,
  the Abyei PCA area and 189 localities. It includes Python and JavaScript packages with
  identical results, a website with a map and a map-maker, and a hand-checked evaluation
  of the matcher. Boundaries follow OCHA's Common Operational Dataset for Sudan (COD-AB v03) and keep its
  CC BY 3.0 IGO licence; code is MIT and Sudan Atlas's own data is CC BY 4.0.
